        &trans             &uc LG(Z)          &uc LG(X)         &td_nav_c_mac 0       &td_nav_v_mac 0     &uc LG(B)              &kp PG_UP  &kp PG_DN  &uc LC(LS(TAB))  &uc LC(TAB)  &uc LG(LS(FSLH))    &trans
