        &kp GRAVE       &kp EXCL   &kp AT    &kp HASH  &kp DLLR   &kp PRCNT  &kp CARET  &kp AMPS          &kp ASTERISK      &kp MINUS         &kp EQUAL      &trans         &trans         &trans
        &kp TILDE       &lhm LCTRL LT &lhm LGUI LBKT &lhm LALT LBRC &lhm LSHFT LPAR &none &none        &td_sym_parens 0  &td_sym_braces 0  &td_sym_brackets 0 &trans       &trans         &kp EQUAL
